/*
 * Renders nothing. Used to override Starlight's `Header` (the top bar is removed
 * — its brand, search, social, and theme controls live in the left rail; see
 * Sidebar.astro) and `MobileMenuFooter` (the rail already provides social + theme
 * inside the mobile menu, so the default footer would duplicate them).
 *
 * Removing the header outright — rather than hiding it — matters: Starlight's
 * search script wires up the FIRST `button[data-open-modal]` in the DOM (the
 * ⌘K hint and shortcut), so a hidden duplicate header search would steal them
 * from the rail.
 */
